{"id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-sigma1-formula.md","title":"Sigma 1 Formula","display":"df-sigma1-formula — Sigma_1 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-sigma1-formula","aliases":["92-df-sigma1-formula"],"display":"df-sigma1-formula — Sigma_1 Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-formula]]"],"source":"第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）","source_status":"层级的本地形式化；特殊 Δ0 前提有条件"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-sigma1-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-sigma1-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma1-formula — Sigma_1 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"层级的本地形式化；特殊 Δ0 前提有条件"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span> (first existential level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式：单个存在量词块+有界公式</li>\n<li>若内部证明公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\\)</span>可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span>，则内部可证性公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\">\\(\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)\\)</span>可取为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^G\">\\(\\Sigma_1^G\\)</span>；外部数值关系<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>本身不是对象语言公式</li>\n<li>当前素数幂编码的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> 表示未在原书直接提供；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可证性可通过存在见证的表示得到，不必先声称该关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span></li>\n<li>标准模型中为真的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句有有限见证；含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的理论可验证相应实例</li>\n<li>对自然数子集，在标准模型语义与通常有效编码下，c.e.集合恰是可由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式定义的集合</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书证明定理码集合是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>，但未证明本库改用的每个裸证明码关系都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>。该文件 Assertion 中若使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span>，应视为附加前提，不是自动事实。选定标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 证明公式后，可证性仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>；规范 Gödel/Henkin 复杂度选择需要保持复杂度的对角构造，不能由任意固定点见证的定义直接推出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 p. 74；第 IX 章 pp. 106–107（PDF 91、123–124）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (first existential level, see [[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaOne}_G(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_1^G","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists v_1\\,\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G(v_1,v_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2049,"backlinks":[{"id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (Sigma-1 formula class, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])"},{"id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea47eabc51d9439c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (Sigma-1 formula class, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])"},{"id":"c4f0c170aff0bb4a","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G$ (arithmetic-hierarchy classes, see [[92-df-delta0-formula]], [[92-df-sigma1-formula]], [[92-df-pi1-formula]])"},{"id":"553707b7a7425e75","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_1^G$ (first existential level, see [[92-df-sigma1-formula]])"},{"id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f2ffbfa1e13e5e2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]"}],"outgoing":["7ce1b12990ae9469","5a1bd470754681a7"]}